From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:06:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] Try-on end to end: real handler, fake gateway, phones

scripts/tryon/serve-local.ts runs the edge function's handler.ts unchanged
on loopback with the in-memory quota and ledger and a scripted fake Lovable
gateway (every error the spec names, plus slow, timeout and the verdict
retries). Its "render" is the shopper's photo with the reference pasted on
and MOCK across it. scripts/tryon/e2e.mjs drives a served vite build in
Pixel 7, iPhone 13, 360x640 and 1440x900 profiles against it: routes and
noindex, photo prep (1152x1536, no EXIF, upright for orientations 1/3/6/8),
consent and the request audit, four pieces into a real Shopify cart read
back, Buy now through CartContext with Shiprocket stubbed, the error matrix
with its refunds, the privacy DOM, Meta and Clarity counts, and the product
page with the chip off and on. fixtures.mjs draws the synthetic photos
(never a person) and writes their EXIF; the small set is committed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
